From: ARLinux contributors
Subject: [PATCH] config: explicitly include algorithm for std::transform

LLVM-MinGW's current libc++ no longer provides this header transitively.
The same explicit include is already present in DXVK 3.x.

diff --git a/src/util/config/config.cpp b/src/util/config/config.cpp
--- a/src/util/config/config.cpp
+++ b/src/util/config/config.cpp
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#include <algorithm>
 #include <array>
 #include <fstream>
 #include <sstream>
